        "message": "feat(PR-S1): greybox TTK, windows and hit-stop math\n\nInteger ticks only: 100 HP / 25 damage -> 4 hits, 11-tick cycle, 36 ticks\n(1200 ms) TTK, 8-tick hit-stop. Illegal windows raise RangeError, never\nclamped — the same refusal rule as the NET-005 anim machine.\n\nThe labelled report says local greybox math, not a playtest or FUN proof.\nNo art, VFX or audio; no GPU/TPU (ND-012).\n\nGDD-COMBAT 0.3 (I9) and its corrupted §18 table repaired. The blueprint acc\n'pnpm sim prs1 --assert' could never run (no sim script); repaired to the vitest\ncommand (twelfth broken form). B2 required co: [qa-engineer] for the\nappend-only prototype report. 7 pnpm test --filter accs remain.\n\nAcceptance: test 4/4, full 146/146, verify 17/17, typecheck 0, tracer green.\n\nAgent: gameplay-engineer\nTask: PR-S1",
